-EFI_STATUS
-EFIAPI
-CoreInternalFreePages (
-  IN EFI_PHYSICAL_ADDRESS  Memory,
-  IN UINTN                 NumberOfPages,
-  OUT EFI_MEMORY_TYPE      *MemoryType OPTIONAL
